17,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAI0trM8AAAABD1UcmQ","user":{"login":"Crissov","id":6200185,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYyMDAxODU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6200185?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Crissov","html_url":"https://github.com/Crissov","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Crissov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Crissov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Crissov/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Crissov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Crissov/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Crissov/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Crissov/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Crissov/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Crissov/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-27T06:59:46Z","updated_at":"2026-05-27T07:00:41Z","body":"The former would not suffice since there are other cases where a `<string>` is treated as an URL without (or in addition to) referencing `<url>` or `<image>`, e.g. within [`image-set()`](https://drafts.csswg.org/css-images-4/#image-set-notation).\n<!--\n[`<image>`](https://drafts.csswg.org/css-images-4/#image-values)\n\n~~~~ ebnf\n\n<url> = <url()> | <src()>\n\n<url()> = url( <string> <url-modifier>* ) | <url-token>\n<src()> = src( <string> <url-modifier>* )\n\n\n<image> = <url> | <image()> | <image-set()> | <cross-fade()> | <element()> | <gradient>\n\nimage() = image( <image-tags>? [ <image-src>? , <color>? ]! )\n<image-tags> = [ ltr | rtl ]\n<image-src> = [ <url> | <string> ]\n\n~~~~\n-->","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/w3c/csswg-drafts/issues/comments/4552203417/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"perfo