","user":{"login":"emilio","id":1323194,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzMjMxOTQ=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1323194?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/emilio","html_url":"https://github.com/emilio","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emilio/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emilio/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emilio/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emilio/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emilio/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emilio/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emilio/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emilio/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emilio/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-27T16:04:47Z","updated_at":"2026-05-27T16:04:47Z","body":"@astearns: I think this might be good enough for an async resolution, I propose to remove that restriction.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/w3c/csswg-drafts/issues/comments/4556315274/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/w3c/csswg-drafts/issues/comments/4559692368","html_url":"https://github.com/w3c/csswg-drafts/issues/13946#issuecomment-4559692368","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/w3c/csswg-drafts/issues/13946","id":4559692368,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAI0trM8AAAABD8diUA","user":{"login":"astearns","id":1380751,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzODA3NTE=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1380751?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/astearns","html_url":"https://github.com/astearns","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astearns/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astearns/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astearns/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astearns/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astearns/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astearns/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astearns/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astearns/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astearns/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-28T00:04:08Z","updated_at":"2026-05-28T00:04:08Z","body":"Let’s get a Blink comment here first, since it sounds like it would be a change for them","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/w3c/csswg-drafts/issues/comments/4559692368/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/w3c/csswg-drafts/issues/comments/4680305304","html_url":"https://github.com/w3c/csswg-drafts/issues/13946#issuecomment-4680305304","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/w3c/csswg-drafts/issues/13946","id":4680305304,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAI0trM8AAAABFvfKmA","user":{"login":"andruud","id":77163,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc3MTYz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/77163?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/andruud","html_url":"https://github.com/andruud","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andruud/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andruud/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andruud/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andruud/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andruud/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andruud/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andruud/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andruud/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andruud/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-11T12:02:23Z","updated_at":"2026-06-11T12:13:00Z","body":"(Got pinged by Emilio on this):\n\nI don't have any technical concerns with just allowing `<url>` again, but we should probably not just reverse the decision in https://github.com/w3c/csswg-drafts/issues/5079 without addressing the points made there (especially by @annevk).\n\nI don't fully understand all the concerns about i18n (are they all specific to `attr()`? Is there even a way currently to \"serialize\" a `<url>` without JS?), but the discussion seems to have concluded \"make it invalid for now due to unclear i18n situation\". If bad i18n things can still happen via `<image>` (etc), then we should likely plug those holes too.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/w3c/csswg-drafts/issues/comments/4680305304/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/w3c/csswg-drafts/issues/comments/4680376174","html_url":"https://github.com/w3c/csswg-drafts/issues/13946#issuecomment-4680376174","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/w3c/csswg-drafts/issues/13946","id":4680376174,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAI0trM8AAAABFvjfbg","user":{"login":"annevk","id":1544111,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE1NDQxMTE=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1544111?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/annevk","html_url":"https://github.com/annevk","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annevk/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annevk/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annevk/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annevk/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annevk/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annevk/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annevk/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annevk/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annevk/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-11T12:11:35Z","updated_at":"2026-06-11T12:11:35Z","body":"Right, there is no security concern here. The concern is this:\n\n> However, it's probably still a bad idea as a serialized URL doesn't work well internationally. It's always in ASCII so IDNA domain names become Punycode, Unicode paths become percent-encoded gibberish. Unless much more work is done (including work user agents have thus far opposed), it seems like the feature would be far too Western-centric to include.\n\nI also think WebKit already fixed its test failure here so I think it's just Gecko that is failing this test.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/w3c/csswg-drafts/issues/comments/4680376174/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/w3c/csswg-drafts/issues/comments/4680393665","html_url":"https://github.com/w3c/csswg-drafts/issues/13946#issuecomment-4680393665","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/w3c/csswg-drafts/issues/13946","id":4680393665,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAI0trM8AAAABFvkjwQ","user":{"login":"emilio","id":1323194,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzMjMxOTQ=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1323194?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/emilio","html_url":"https://github.com/emilio","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emilio/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emilio/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emilio/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emilio/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emilio/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emilio/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emilio/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emilio/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emilio/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-11T12:13:33Z","updated_at":"2026-06-11T12:13:33Z","body":"@annevk WebKit fails the same subtest of https://wpt.fyi/results/css/css-values/attr-security.html?label=master&label=experimental&aligned as Gecko, FWIW.\n\n","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/w3c/csswg-drafts/issues/comments/4680393665/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/w3c/csswg-drafts/issues/comments/4680427758","html_url":"https://github.com/w3c/csswg-drafts/issues/13946#issuecomment-4680427758","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/w3c/csswg-drafts/issues/13946","id":4680427758,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAI0trM8AAAABFvmo7g","user":{"login":"emilio","id":1323194,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzMjMxOTQ=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1323194?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/emilio","html_url":"https://github.com/emilio","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emilio/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emilio/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emilio/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emilio/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptio